  "overview": {
    "text": "The Avogadro constant (Nₐ) is the exact conversion factor between amount of substance, measured in moles, and counts of specified entities: 6.02214076 × 10²³ mol⁻¹. One mole therefore contains exactly that many entities, which may be atoms, molecules, ions, electrons, or specified groups; it matters to state what is being counted. The constant connects the particle counts used in chemistry to the amount of substance in a sample. It is one of seven SI defining constants, and fixing its value defines the mole. The name honors Amedeo Avogadro, but he did not invent the mole; that term appeared much later.",
    "source_urls": [
      "https://www.nist.gov/pml/special-publication-330/sp-330-section-2",
      "https://www.bipm.org/en/measurement-units/si-defining-constants",
      "https://www.nist.gov/si-redefinition/redefining-mole"
    ]
  },
  "key_facts": [
    {
      "text": "Its symbol is Nₐ, and its exact SI value is 6.02214076 × 10²³ mol⁻¹.",
      "source_urls": [
        "https://www.nist.gov/pml/special-publication-330/sp-330-section-2",
        "https://www.bipm.org/en/measurement-units/si-defining-constants"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A mole contains exactly 6.02214076 × 10²³ specified elementary entities.",
      "source_urls": [
        "https://www.nist.gov/pml/special-publication-330/sp-330-section-2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Entities counted can include atoms, molecules, ions, electrons, or specified groups of particles.",
      "source_urls": [
        "https://www.nist.gov/pml/special-publication-330/sp-330-section-2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The entity being counted should be identified precisely, for example by naming a molecule’s chemical formula.",
      "source_urls": [
        "https://www.nist.gov/pml/special-publication-330/sp-330-section-2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The name commemorates Amedeo Avogadro, but the mole was not his invention; the term appeared nearly 1900.",
      "source_urls": [
        "https://www.nist.gov/si-redefinition/redefining-mole"
      ]
    }
  ],
